{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "customer-seli-florist-v1-collection",
    "name": "Seli Florist - Customer Alur & Aktivitas (v1.0)",
    "description": "# 🌸 Seli Florist E-Commerce - Customer Workflow Collection\n\nDokumen Postman Collection resmi yang mengurutkan seluruh alur perjalanan (Customer Journey) pengguna secara terstruktur dari **Registrasi (1.1)** hingga **Checkout DP 50% & Pengelolaan Order (5.6)**.\n\n### 📌 Fitur Utama Collection Ini:\n1. **Urutan Poin Terstruktur**: Menggunakan kode poin (1.1, 1.2, 2.1, dst.) sesuai alur aktivitas pelanggan.\n2. **Uji Otomatis Status Code (Tests Script)**: Setiap request dilengkapi script pengujian otomatis (`200 OK`, `201 Created`, `400 Bad Request`, `401 Unauthorized`, `404 Not Found`, `409 Conflict`).\n3. **Auto-Save Access Token & Variables**: Begitu Login Customer (1.4) berhasil, `accessToken` dan data user otomatis tersimpan ke variabel collection.\n4. **Dokumentasi Profesional**: Setiap request dilengkapi deskripsi teknis, penjelasan header, parameter, serta ekspektasi balikan JSON.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customerEmail", "value": "budi.santoso@gmail.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customerPassword", "value": "PasswordKuat123!", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "sampleProductId", "value": "9a9cfebc-b1a2-4129-a3b9-69590e995790", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "sampleCartItemId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
